{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47748","headline":"留题阁皂观 · 伊用昌","name":"留题阁皂观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花洞门前吠似雷，险声流断俗尘埃。\n雨喷山脚毒龙起，月照松梢孤鹤回。\n萝幕秋高添碧翠，画帘时卷到楼台。\n两坛诗客何年去，去後门关更不开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伊用昌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}